{"/api/discogs/artist/1139200/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"1139200","image":"https://i.discogs.com/euLzQVIXlFJ3-Ww8FF1UsXrsbHhV2VxKuPcuF-teHbw/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:400/w:600/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTExMzky/MDAtMTY2Mzg5OTQ0/MS04NDc4LmpwZWc.jpeg","imageThumb":"https://i.discogs.com/tmvUAQcrD6CbMLvrb5ahUj_reXF66KzDROsvHaLp_z8/rs:fit/g:sm/q:40/h:150/w:150/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTExMzky/MDAtMTY2Mzg5OTQ0/MS04NDc4LmpwZWc.jpeg","profile":"Japanese electronic producer, and artist. \r\n\r\nHorikawa is a self-taught sound designer who from the age of 12 has spent most of his time and talent manipulating and grinding up all sorts of sounds. He puts no limits to his longings for acoustic explorations and mixes different genres, styles and instruments in order to plunge the audience into his very personal musical world. \r\n\r\nHis eclectic influences include [a=Jack DeJohnette], [a=Lester Bowie], [a=Pete Rock], [a=DJ Premier], et al. When uses his samplers, electro, jazz, hip hop and experimental music rub shoulders with each other naturally. \r\n","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:artist:1139200","relations":{"aliases":null,"groups":null,"members":null,"namevariations":["Y. Horikawa","Yoshi Horikawa"]},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/artist/1139200-Yosi-Horikawa","type":"artist","urls":["https://www.myspace.com/yosihorikawa","https://soundcloud.com/yosi-horikawa","https://yosihorikawa.bandcamp.com"]}},"/api/discogs/artist/17551/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"17551","image":"https://i.discogs.com/-VS2tBVfXRxEBAufAGqh45Es6I4TwMhkIcVG6wnoBco/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:450/w:600/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTE3NTUx/LTE0OTk5MjQ2Njct/NDQ5Ny5qcGVn.jpeg","imageThumb":"https://i.discogs.com/xvWDtVGrRE-iDfPZLpqEmdx7PSkrZrcFJv143tXeN8g/rs:fit/g:sm/q:40/h:150/w:150/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTE3NTUx/LTE0OTk5MjQ2Njct/NDQ5Ny5qcGVn.jpeg","profile":"The Gap Band was an American funk band p